":"We revealed to Moses and his brother: ‘House your people in Egypt and make these houses places of worship; keep up the prayer; give good news to the believers!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"And We inspired","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَخِيهِ","en_gloss":"and his brother","transliteration":"wa-akhīhi","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَبَوَّءَا","en_gloss":"Settle","transliteration":"tabawwaā","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِقَوْمِكُمَا","en_gloss":"your people","transliteration":"liqawmikumā","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمِصْرَ","en_gloss":"in Egypt","transliteration":"bimiṣ'ra","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بُيُوتًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) houses","transliteration":"buyūtan","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱجْعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and make","transliteration":"wa-ij'ʿalū","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بُيُوتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your houses","transliteration":"buyūtakum","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قِبْلَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) places of worship","transliteration":"qib'latan","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"and establish","transliteration":"wa-aqīmū","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۗ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَبَشِّرِ","en_gloss":"And give glad tidings","transliteration":"wabashiri","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"10:87"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٨٧","en_gloss":"(87)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:87"}]},{"verse_key":"10:88","surah":10,"ayah":88,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّكَ ءَاتَيْتَ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَأَهُۥ زِينَةً وَأَمْوَٰلًا فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا رَبَّنَا لِيُضِلُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِكَ ۖ رَبَّنَا ٱطْمِسْ عَلَىٰٓ أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ وَٱشْدُدْ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَلَا يُؤْمِنُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَلِيمَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And Moses said, ‘Our Lord, You have given Pharaoh and his chiefs splendour and wealth in this present life and here they are, Lord, leading others astray from Your path. Our Lord, obliterate their wealth and harden their hearts so that they do not believe until they see the agonizing torment.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And Musa said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"And Musa said","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَاتَيْتَ","en_gloss":"have given","transliteration":"ātayta","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِرْعَوْنَ","en_gloss":"Firaun","transliteration":"fir'ʿawna","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَلَأَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and his chiefs","transliteration":"wamala-ahu","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":8,"ar":"زِينَةًۭ","en_gloss":"splendor","transliteration":"zīnatan","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَمْوَٰلًۭا","en_gloss":"and wealth","transliteration":"wa-amwālan","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِيُضِلُّوا۟","en_gloss":"That they may lead astray","transliteration":"liyuḍillū","verse_key":"10:88"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"fr